  "about": "I've spent my career in the integration space, at eBridge, Jitterbit, and now iPaaS.com and honestly, the more things change, the more the core problem stays the same: businesses are running on disconnected systems, and the cost of that gap is real.\n\nAs Director of Partnerships at iPaaS.com, I focus on building the kinds of partnerships that actually move the needle with eCommerce platforms, ERPs, WMS providers, and the VARs/SIs and agencies that support them. My job is to help partners stop putting out fires on one-off integration projects and start building recurring, predictable revenue instead.\n\nBefore iPaaS.com, I led partnerships at Jitterbit and held sales leadership roles across the integration ecosystem. I've seen a lot of approaches, what works, what doesn't, and where the real opportunities are hiding.\n\nIf you're exploring how integration fits into your GTM or looking for a platform your clients can actually grow with, let's connect. I'm always up for a good conversation.\n\u2026 more",
